{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fOw59ulCaW1795616974.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>兩電下月將調整燃料費。</p><p></p><p>港燈宣布，下月燃料費繼續向下調整，至每度電52.3仙，是從9月全年最高位的每度電60.7仙持續下降。至於中電，下月燃料費會上調至每度電48.5仙，自3月起一直呈上升趨勢。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:03:57.851929+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:14.436436+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:19.674459+00:00","content_hash":"10ea9087ee8bd0bc9e38880ce468afe5745920d47e2caed0691b239706b96cd5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:03:57.851929+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}